WEBVTT

00:00:53.749 --> 00:00:55.185
[CLICKING]

00:00:57.492 --> 00:00:58.536
[FZZT]

00:01:01.148 --> 00:01:02.279
[FZZT]

00:01:04.890 --> 00:01:05.978
[FZZT]

00:01:08.764 --> 00:01:10.157
[FZZT]

00:01:13.769 --> 00:01:14.770
[FZZT]

00:01:16.511 --> 00:01:17.947
[CLICK]

00:01:17.990 --> 00:01:20.254
[CAT MEOWS]

00:01:20.297 --> 00:01:23.083
I SHOULD HAVE KNOWN
THAT YOU WOULD BE HERE...

00:01:23.126 --> 00:01:25.868
PROFESSOR McGONAGALL.

00:01:35.225 --> 00:01:36.618
[FOOTSTEPS]

00:01:36.661 --> 00:01:40.230
GOOD EVENING,
PROFESSOR DUMBLEDORE.

00:01:42.319 --> 00:01:45.453
ARE THE RUMORS TRUE,
ALBUS?

00:01:45.496 --> 00:01:48.151
I'M AFRAID SO,
PROFESSOR.

00:01:48.195 --> 00:01:51.154
THE GOOD AND THE BAD.

00:01:51.198 --> 00:01:52.851
AND THE BOY?

00:01:52.895 --> 00:01:54.897
HAGRID IS BRINGING HIM.

00:01:54.940 --> 00:01:57.073
DO YOU THINK IT WISE
TO TRUST HAGRID

00:01:57.117 --> 00:01:58.814
WITH SOMETHING AS
IMPORTANT AS THIS?

00:01:58.857 --> 00:02:03.166
AH, PROFESSOR, I WOULD
TRUST HAGRID WITH MY LIFE.

00:02:03.210 --> 00:02:05.212
[ENGINE WHINING]

00:02:14.177 --> 00:02:17.833
[TIRES SCREECH]

00:02:22.925 --> 00:02:24.492
PROFESSOR DUMBLEDORE, SIR.

00:02:24.535 --> 00:02:27.277
PROFESSOR McGONAGALL.

00:02:27.321 --> 00:02:29.323
NO PROBLEMS I TRUST,
HAGRID?

00:02:29.366 --> 00:02:31.194
NO, SIR.

00:02:31.238 --> 00:02:32.891
LITTLE TYKE
FELL ASLEEP

00:02:32.935 --> 00:02:34.980
JUST AS WE WERE
FLYING OVER BRISTOL.

00:02:35.024 --> 00:02:36.373
HEH.

00:02:36.417 --> 00:02:39.594
TRY NOT TO WAKE HIM.

00:02:39.637 --> 00:02:41.204
THERE YOU GO.

00:02:46.949 --> 00:02:50.474
ALBUS, DO YOU REALLY
THINK IT'S SAFE,

00:02:50.518 --> 00:02:52.259
LEAVING HIM
WITH THESE PEOPLE?

00:02:52.302 --> 00:02:53.695
I'VE WATCHED THEM
ALL DAY.

00:02:53.738 --> 00:02:57.394
THEY'RE THE WORST SORT
OF MUGGLES IMAGINABLE.

00:02:57.438 --> 00:02:58.743
THEY REALLY ARE--

00:02:58.787 --> 00:03:02.356
THE ONLY FAMILY HE HAS.

00:03:02.399 --> 00:03:03.705
THIS BOY WILL BE FAMOUS.

00:03:03.748 --> 00:03:06.186
THERE WON'T BE A CHILD
IN OUR WORLD

00:03:06.229 --> 00:03:07.274
WHO DOESN'T KNOW
HIS NAME.

00:03:07.317 --> 00:03:10.102
EXACTLY.
HE'S FAR BETTER OFF

00:03:10.146 --> 00:03:12.801
GROWING UP AWAY
FROM ALL OF THAT.

00:03:15.456 --> 00:03:17.675
UNTIL HE IS READY.

00:03:26.031 --> 00:03:27.903
[SNIFFLES]

00:03:27.946 --> 00:03:30.035
[CLEARS THROAT]

00:03:30.079 --> 00:03:31.950
THERE, THERE, HAGRID.

00:03:31.994 --> 00:03:34.823
IT'S NOT REALLY
GOOD-BYE, AFTER ALL.

00:03:47.488 --> 00:03:49.446
GOOD LUCK...

00:03:49.490 --> 00:03:51.840
HARRY POTTER.

00:03:57.324 --> 00:03:59.326
[THUNDER]

00:04:08.465 --> 00:04:10.075
[CLICK]

00:04:10.119 --> 00:04:11.084
Aunt Petunia:
UP. GET UP.

